OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son jailed after
OL,4,A#900,000 Glasgow Airport cannabis swoop
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father and son who tried to smuggle
OL,7,F#900,000 of cannabis into Scotland have
OL,8,Fbeen jailed.
OL,10,FStephen Harding, 67, and Bradley
OL,11,FHarding, 37, were stopped at Glasgow
OL,12,FAirport by Border Force officials on 23
OL,13,FNovember 2024.
OL,15,FThe pair, from Tamworth in
OL,16,FStaffordshire, had travelled from
OL,17,FThailand with four cases between them.
OL,19,FThe High Court in Glasgow heard there
OL,20,Fwere dozens of vacuum sealed packages
OL,21,Fof green herbal material stashed
OL,22,Finside.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
